OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including Elgar's iconic
OL,9,     FEnigma Variations performed by the
OL,10,     FBBC National Orchestra of Wales.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: Cyril Scott
OL,12,     F5/5. Donald Macleod follows Cyril
OL,13,     FScott through the final decades of
OL,14,     Fhis life, including his turbulent
OL,15,     Frelationship with the BBC.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FThe London Bulgarian Choir live in
OL,18,     Fstudio. Curator Ann Dumas on
OL,19,     FPainting The French Riviera, a new
OL,20,     Fexhibition about to open at the
OL,21,     FRoyal Academy of Arts.
